From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:25:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): port end4-pC's Background page

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: modules/ii/settings/pages/BackgroundConfig.qml
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
Problem: the ii settings app has no Background configuration page; the fork has one but
targets a second-wallpaper/lockscreen system, extra clock widgets, and niri that the pin
does not have.
Port: hand-ported (controls for fork-only features dropped, see docs/II-INTEGRATION.md;
wallpaper selector opened over IPC; clock style options trimmed to the pin's cookie/digital
range); pin controls with no fork equivalent carried over
Drop when: upstream ships equivalent pages, or the settings port is abandoned.
---
